      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "10. Section 11(4)(i) of the Kerala Buildings (Lease and Rent Control) Act, deal with eviction of the tenant on the ground of subletting."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b47bfd6c6851498b8469b302752cc951_58",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The same reads as under:\n\"Section 11(4)(i) if the tenant after the commencement of this Act, without the consent of the landlord, transfers his right under the lease or sub- lets the entire building or any portion thereof if the lease does "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "deeefe2a9cd94f329ff02fb37cc18a3a_59",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On analysis of the provisions of the Act, it is evident RCREV. NO. 25 OF 2022 that landlord has a ground to seek the eviction of the tenant on the ground of subletting."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c396262978b34c1e80eda36d3aec5af4_60",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In order to establish the subletting landlord has not only to plead the date and month but also other material."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "997a6e86270f41d39f459bd67bea3c56_61",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In support of the case no doubt no specific date and month has been written but it was preceded by a legal notice Ext.A2 dated 08.06.2018 which was replied vide Ext.A4 dated 27.07.2018."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "29495391a47b4645be625a621a7d9678_62",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "But the tenant had not been consistent on the stand and for the first time coined a story that respondent No.2 was working in the shop as an employee."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e3cbd88b8fd04d01841a6f23ff22f980_63",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The landlord was supposed to place on record following documents to belie the case of the landlord; 1) details of customers, 2) Profit and Loss, 3) Balance Sheet, 4) Sales Tax Returns, 5) registration under the Kerala Shops and establishmen"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9b0474c5ee834671941251bbca2797a3_64",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On the contrary the documents Exts.B1 to B4 placed on record reveals that attempt was made to obtain a certificate that respondent No.2 was an employee, after the institution of petition."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "488d8dae6b2143bfbc097e02a0f87efb_65",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nLabour Officer to a categoric question in cross examination denied that she ever visited the shop in question."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1ff3c003d02c43b7983ae05880011e5f_66",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Thus the identity of respondent No.2 to be an employee of the respondent No.1- petitioner remained a mistery."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "22547ff84b6b4daab969fbd5b2992e4e_67",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "We would be RCREV. NO. 25 OF 2022 failing in our duty in not adverting to certain paragraphs 2 to 7 of the report of the Advocate Commissioner, which read as under:\n2. Nobody was present in the petition schedule shop room during inspection."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0745547690f4405baf6d7c0e03bd92ed_68",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is revealed in inspection that, in the shop room with No.20/377 and in the petition scheduled shop room business is conducting as one unit."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "64d1ddfec8344ba2a2c36efc30429395_69",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "During inspection, the 2 nd respondent, who was sitting at the cash counter of room No. 20/377 had signed on the back side of the warrant."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "93f0bf5ad1d740afb54f54d96d6d9ea7_70",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n3. I could not see any building number in the petition schedule room."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "643e696480ae47abbf11efa04028ac89_71",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "A white paper in which printed as 'Shamna Traders' is seen affixed in the petition schedule room as well as on the wall on the northern side."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7ff7402f6c234efea32b3357ff625742_72",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Just near to the white printed white paper affixed on the wall in which Shamna Traders in printed a price list of K.M.Traders is seen hanged."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a23f74c45e4f40f88837958dae2399b1_73",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It could see only a big weighing machine in the scheduled room during inspection."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0be07c869d03446881eeae1e136d475c_74",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "When it was asked, the 2nd respond who was present in the schedule room during inspection, admitted that only a big weighing machine in available in the room."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3577c15a305941669d174f66768f2f7b_75",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "4. The room No.20/377 mentioned in the petition"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "aa4e3f24840f428c925a78c26a621c05_76",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": ", is the room next room to the petition schedule room, on the northern side."
    },
    {
