      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "At the end of the inspection, husband of the R1 by name Poker came to there and after his arrival, he was siting at the cash counter."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "46c857871f4c4adf9e78ea3d64e5dd5c_95",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He tolled me that, he was at mosque for prayer and further tolled that, he is conducting the business on behalf of R1.\n12."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "958df1cb54454b9ba9da61cf10bfacd1_96",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Petitioner - respondent No.1 - tenant has not been able to belie the aforementioned report either in the cross examination or by bringing the evidence as noticed above, much less did not step into the witness box."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9c297c6476e64cd79b7bfb23671959e5_97",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The question of identity of the property would not arise for the reason that vide Ext.A1 and A5 both properties had been separately let out by the respondent ie., Ext.A1 to the petitioner - respondent No.1 and Ext.A5 to the respondent No.2,"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ec04b666254740dd9d6aee504d92d1d7_99",
